    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "计数时使用的数，组成自然数集合 $N$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 189,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0195#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "自然数集合包含于比它更大的整数集 $Z$：$N\\subset Z$. 集合 $N$ 和 $Z$ 之间的包含关系如图 $40$ 所示. 大圆中没有画细斜线的部分对应于非正整数集合，即由负整数和零组成的集合. 通常说，非正整数集是整数集内自然数集的余集（或补集）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 189,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0195#6"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "disposition": "The same book explicitly puts zero and negative integers outside N. This retained definition supplies N15 exercise328 convention; no exercise, answer, choice or figure was opened.",
